item.description:
Fetches /course-grades and /study-progress to generate strengths, weaknesses, and study habits.

Request Parameters:  
None

Response Structure:  
{  
"highest_grade": {  
"subject": "Mathematics",  
"grade": 95.5  
},  
"lowest_grade": {  
"subject": "Physics",  
"grade": 70.0  
},  
"most_studied_subject": {  
"subject": "Mathematics",  
"study_hours": 20.5  
},  
"least_studied_subject": {  
"subject": "History",  
"study_hours": 5.0  
}  
}

Error Handling:

- 500 Internal Server Error: Failed to generate statistics.
